 "title": "The Leviathan Stirs",
 "kind": "hero",
 "seed": 5909,
 "intro": [
  "Skarn Ashborn himself has come down into the Barrow Below. The court cannot match the Host fire for fire, so the Regent reaches for the oldest thing in the fen: a winged colossus that drowned in the mire before the five peoples had names, and has been rotting there ever since.",
  "A thing that old needs three things to rise: a heart, a name and a bell to call it. The heart is under the mire, the name is in a fen-witch's head, and the bell hangs at the Mire Gate, where Skarn's raiders have camped.",
  "Raise the rotwing leviathan and break Skarn's host."
 ],
 "outro": [
  {
   "text": [
    "Skarn pulls back into the deepest tunnels, where the Host has made its own towns out of the old tombs. The leviathan circles above the fen under the red sky.",
    "Ysmay watches it and begins to speak of crowns."
   ]
  }
 ],
